{
  "bodyHash": "5p5MgPgguiI=",
  "content": "<p><strong>这款维京主题模组将让你体验维京人的生活，享用维京美食，</strong><strong>并赋予铜以真正的用途。</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/966/36/image-6.webp\" width=\"825\" height=\"415\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>目标：</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>踏上通往阿斯加德英灵殿的征程并非易事。你的旅程将穿越九界，每一界都有独特的挑战、Boss和生态环境。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>随着进展，你必须收集八种不同的符文，用以制作一双特殊的靴子。</p><p>制作出能带你前往阿斯加德的靴子后，你将激活彩虹桥——一座连接诸神国度的宇宙桥梁，那里永恒的战火与荣耀正等待着你。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>诸神注视着，一位充满维京精神的勇士，将晋升至英雄的殿堂。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>武器：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/891/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-5.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/663/44/310/172/model13.png\" width=\"304\" height=\"183\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>官方维基：</strong></p><p><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbronze-viking-mod.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fBronze_%2526_viking_mod_Wiki%2523Articles%253a\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bronze-viking-mod.fandom.com/wiki/Bronze_%26_viking_mod_Wiki#Articles%3A</a></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>模组新增内容：</strong></p><p>新维度</p><p>新Boss</p><p>新植物和食物</p><p>现有物品的新合成配方</p><p>北欧传说</p><p>多种不同的盔甲</p><p>众多新材料</p><p>一些装饰性方块</p><p>大量植物、动物和巨型怪物……</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/966/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-55.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/966/39/image-1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"825\" height=\"492\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>盔甲：</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/894/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-59.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/895/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-60.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/897/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-61.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"304\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/898/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-62.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"304\" height=\"171\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>维度</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>本模组新增了北欧神话中的七个维度：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"color:#0cf\"><em>尼福尔海姆</em></span>，迷雾与冰霜之地。（浮冰传送门）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/703/403/310/172/niflheim.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"159\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/923/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-21.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/925/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-22.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/926/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-23.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/928/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-24.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/930/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-26.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/931/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-27.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"color:#0f0\"><em>斯瓦塔尔法海姆</em></span>，黑暗森林，地下矿藏丰富。（橡木原木传送门）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/660/352/310/172/model5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"169\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/932/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-29.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/933/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-30.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/935/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-31.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/936/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-32.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/937/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-33.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"color:#f00\"><em>约顿海姆</em></span>，巨山森林的险境之地。（石砖传送门）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/703/405/310/172/jotunheim.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"158\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/942/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-34.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/943/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-35.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/944/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-36.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/946/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-37.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/948/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-38.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/949/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-39.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/966/38/image-3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"825\" height=\"424\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"color:#fc0\"><em>华纳海姆</em></span>，以太般的浮空岛屿，居住着魔法生物。（錾制石英传送门）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/703/409/310/172/vanaheim.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"158\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/950/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-40.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/952/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-41.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/955/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-42.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/959/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-43.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/960/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-44.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/961/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-45.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"color:#f0f\"><em>海姆冥界</em></span>，亡者与不死者的黑暗国度。（传送门位于尼福尔海姆）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/703/406/310/172/helheim.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"157\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/900/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-9.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/901/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-10.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/903/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-11.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/905/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-13.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/907/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-14.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/910/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-15.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/912/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-16.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/915/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-17.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/920/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-18.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/922/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-19.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"172\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/966/40/image-4.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"825\" height=\"481\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- <strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><em>亚尔夫海姆</em></span></strong>，光精灵的狂野家园。（橡木原木传送门）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/703/408/310/172/alfheim.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"159\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/966/37/image-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"824\" height=\"422\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- <em><span style=\"color:#f00\">阿</span><span style=\"color:#f60\">斯</span><span style=\"color:#fc0\">加</span><span style=\"color:#0f0\">德</span></em>，最终目的地。（彩虹桥框架传送门）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/703/407/310/172/asgard.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/962/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-46.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/963/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-48.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/964/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-50.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/902/965/310/172/bronze-and-viking-mod-screenshots-51.jpg\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>为了补全九界，进度中提及主世界为<span style=\"color:#999\"><em>米德加德</em></span>，地狱为<span style=\"color:#f60\"><em>穆斯贝尔海姆</em></span>（火之国）。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/703/404/310/172/muspellheim.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"160\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>自定义Boss</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em>法尔勃蒂</em>——洛基之父，冰霜巨人之王，会向玩家投掷冰块，掉落冰冻之卵。</p>\n<p><em>海拉</em>——亡者女王，向玩家投掷药水并自行治疗，召唤亡灵，击败后掉落死亡符文。</p>\n<p><em>托尔</em>——金属与雷霆之神，被击中时召唤闪电，掉落他的魔法锤。</p>\n<p><em>甘道夫·阿尔夫海森</em>——北欧传说中的古代国王，统治着亚尔夫海姆，持有奥萨拉符文。</p>\n<p><em>索尔</em>——太阳符文守护者，驾日车巡游天空，拥有与烈焰人相同的能力。</p>\n<p><em>尼德霍格</em>——毒化冰冻之卵可召唤这条可怕的龙，掉落冰霜符文。</p>\n<p><em>胡吉</em>——思维的化身，使用乌特迦·洛基的号角后生成。</p>\n<p><em>洛吉</em>——火焰的化身，击败胡吉后生成，掉落防御符文。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>八大符文</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>- <span style=\"color:#0cf\">寒冰符文</span>，移除火焰与中毒效果，击败尼德霍格后获得。</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"color:#f60\">火焰符文</span>，使生物着火，并可作为打火石使用，用穆斯贝尔海姆的材料合成。</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"color:#0f0\">植物符文</span>，无限骨粉，用斯瓦塔尔法海姆的材料合成。</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"color:#ff0\">太阳符文</span>，驱散黑夜，在华纳海姆找到。</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"color:#f00\">防御符文</span>，赋予玩家抗性提升，由洛吉掉落。</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"color:#999\">生命符文</span>，消耗金锭恢复生命，从米德加德的古老旅者处获得。</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"color:#f0f\">死亡符文</span>，击败海拉后获得。</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"color:#000\">奥萨拉符文</span>，设置重生点，击败甘道夫·阿尔夫海森后获得。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>模组视频：</strong></p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UJmYoeXUz4o?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<strong>免责声明</strong></p><p>这是我的第一个模组，随着时间推移我可能会不断更新并修复出现的各种漏洞。我对最终成果感到非常自豪，希望你喜欢。</p><p>同时，我想将这个模组献给我已故的丹麦祖父，他一直为自己的北欧文化感到骄傲。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
